====Additional fixes and adjustments:====

* In relation to the changes above, we've adjusted the Bounty Task XP so that the position of Bounty Task within the meta is kept intact. As part of this, Bounty Task XP has been reduced by 25%.
* We've also tackled an issue where the player's worn gear wasn't contributing as expected to the damage calculations. We've enabled ranged modifiers such as the Void Armour effect and Ranged Prayers to work in cannon combat, meaning your worn ranged gear will now correctly apply its stats to the overall damage.

We’re also aware that boat combat can feel overly intense against some high-level sea creatures, particularly as they’re currently fought in multi-combat areas. To address this, we’re working on introducing single-way combat encounters for the Vampyre Kraken, Armoured Kraken, and Great White Shark. While we don’t have an ETA just yet, we’re aiming to release this change in the coming weeks.

==Last Man Standing QoL Tweaks==
<u>[https://secure.runescape.com/m=news/a=13/easter-2026--pvp-qol-improvements?oldschool=1#PvP Last week]</u>, we released a series of PvP Quality of Life changes, including for the Last Man Standing minigame. After monitoring your feedback thoroughly, we've made the following tweaks:

* Increased the timer before a game is forcefully ended to 20 minutes, up from 16 minutes 15 seconds.
* Venom effect from the Noxious Halberd and Burn effect from the Eclipse Set are now cleared from your player character when you win a fight in Last Man Standing.
* You can now hold up to 2 Sanfew Serums in your Last Man Standing setup, rather than just 1.
* Rebalanced the points awarded, increasing them for the end of the game.
** Increased placement points by 1 for the last 9 players standing.
** Increased kill points by 1 for 3 kills and 5 kills.
** This means that the new max points a player can get is now 9 points, in the case that the player places 1st (6 points) and scores 5 or more kills (3 points).

