We've got more ''upcoming'' changes we'd like to make but didn't have time to implement this week, including:

* For the "Max/Med" starter kit, replace the Rune Crossbow and diamond bolts (e) with a Dragon Crossobw and Opal dragon bolts (e).
* Replace the Dragon dagger with Dragon claws in the "Max/Med" starter kit.
* Add the Oathplate helm into the "Max/Med defensive" loot pool.
* If the "Automatically smash empty vials" option is disabled, players will keep their vials in their Inventory once a potion is fully consumed. The vials will be cleared upon killing another player.
* Adjust the default preset for players who have never played Last Man Standing before to have 3 Saradomin brews, 2 Sanfew serums and 10 sharks.
* Set the default spellbook to Ancient Magicks if the player is brand new to the Last Man Standing gear setup.
* Allow Zuriel's staff in Last Man Standing to autocast Ancient Magicks spells as well.
* Replace the Berserker ring with the Berserker ring (i) in the starter kit for all builds.

In addition, an ''upcoming'' tweak for Emir's Arena:

* Add Ancient warriors' weapons to the list of items that can be used at Emir's Arena.

While these changes didn't make it in this week, we're aiming to release them as soon as possible. Appreciate your patience while we work on these changes, and we'll keep you updated.

